  "description": "Host defaults for ATIS services: one call per host type (API or MVC WebUI) wiring Serilog/Graylog, health endpoints, CORS, Consul, correlation ids, ProblemDetails, forwarded headers, and — for APIs — Swagger, versioning and JWT bearer.",
